  "details": "It'd be nice to have the option to have a separate set of saved wing menus for the two different menu types as they have different use cases.  \nEg;  I might want Avatars and (for argument's sake) the world's local menu/inventory/Fun Things panel on the hand menu for quick use while playing in a world, but if I'm opening up the full menu it might be more useful for me to have perhaps Worlds and Friends open there to see where I want to go next/who I want to join.",
